
## `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/

# Environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor and operating system
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Temporary and backup files
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log
~$*

# Streamlit
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# Large generated artefacts (review before committing)
# Uncomment only if these files should not be versioned:
# *.pkl
# *.joblib